# QuizCred core

- Monorepo: `backend/` NestJS + Prisma, `frontend/` Next.js App Router. See `AGENTS.md`.
- Credits: ledger + transactional balance in `backend/src/credits/ledger.ts`. No client-side scoring or balance writes.
- API success: `{ message, data }`; errors: `{ statusCode, code, message }`. Frontend uses `frontend/lib/api.ts`.
- JWT Bearer on protected routes; admin via `@Roles(Role.ADMIN)`. Web session in `frontend/lib/session.ts`.
- Before claiming behavior, check `backend/test/app.e2e-spec.ts` or README “How balances stay consistent”.
- After learning something non-obvious, follow `.cursor/CONTEXT-HARNESS.md` (LEARNINGS + rules).
